/Title (To identify the main andinfluential variants, we filtered the variants in the file in a stepwise manner.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 687 0 R
/Next 699 0 R
>>
endobj
694 0 obj
<<
/Title (The remaining variants were screened using ACMG criteria, and those that were Pathogenic, and Likely Pathogenic VUS were retained for further steps.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 687 0 R
/Prev 700 0 R
>>
endobj
695 0 obj
<<
/Title (3.3. Zygosity and Inheritance Filtering)
